    "text": "By currents ,\n12 hours ago The Shelby County Health Department is scheduled to conduct mosquito-control spraying in Lakeland on Thursday, August 27, as part of an ongoing effort to reduce mosquito populations capable of transmitting West Nile virus. The truck-mounted spraying is part of the county’s mosquito surveillance and control program. Health Department officials routinely... Read full article\n2",
